    "detailed_description": "<h1>JOIN DISCORD TO PARTICIPATE IN FUTURE PLAYTESTS!</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras/0649cadbaf8f184c96d68dbc202eb3a1.avif?t=1702182550\" /></div><br><br>Last Chickenburg is an action-packed strategy based sandbox rpg, in which you will take control of a member of the House of Chicken in order to take back Chickenburg from the Chickenburg Baron. Fight to build your base, gather resources and take back the land that is rightfully yours from the humans who wish to eradicate and enslave you.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras/c3b827fd52a282cf55009982caa5ea71.poster.avif?t=1702182550\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras/c3b827fd52a282cf55009982caa5ea71.webm?t=1702182550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras/c3b827fd52a282cf55009982caa5ea71.mp4?t=1702182550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras/ff196fc4f01fc201091effb16655eb84.webp?t=1702182550\" /></div><br><br>Last Chickenburg has a simple yet direct combat system appropriate for players of all skill levels. Select suitable armor type and weapons for each combat situation carefully to ensure victory against the enemies. Don\u2019t forget to rest up before you go!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras/929aa72251e7bbd15ac9de5f073e6e72.poster.avif?t=1702182550\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras/929aa72251e7bbd15ac9de5f073e6e72.webm?t=1702182550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras/929aa72251e7bbd15ac9de5f073e6e72.mp4?t=1702182550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras/718e3472a15bdddd96ddc6d7725aca4a.poster.avif?t=1702182550\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras/718e3472a15bdddd96ddc6d7725aca4a.webm?t=1702182550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras/718e3472a15bdddd96ddc6d7725aca4a.mp4?t=1702182550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras/8231235b172d7fe3ccfe23b23e77af12.webp?t=1702182550\" /></div><br><br>Survive in the tough wilderness by harvesting food and materials. Use those materials to craft a workbench and create basic weapons and armor to help you thrive in the hostile environment.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras/e6e44e910dc7bbac1074dd974e1c2db9.poster.avif?t=1702182550\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras/e6e44e910dc7bbac1074dd974e1c2db9.webm?t=1702182550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras/e6e44e910dc7bbac1074dd974e1c2db9.mp4?t=1702182550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras/9afae5d029561e852eca9d3830c3a8f1.poster.avif?t=1702182550\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras/9afae5d029561e852eca9d3830c3a8f1.webm?t=1702182550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras/9afae5d029561e852eca9d3830c3a8f1.mp4?t=1702182550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras/f447d5462e9897e1a8360226acbba0cd.webp?t=1702182550\" /></div><br><br>Recruit companions you meet while taking back Chickenburg to help you in your cause. Bring them with you on raids of enemy encampments. Put them to work in your settlements building weapons and armor to defend against enemy attacks, or send them on transport missions to bring resources to your other settlements.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras/778d48ae40aa02947626f53f45773346.poster.avif?t=1702182550\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras/778d48ae40aa02947626f53f45773346.webm?t=1702182550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras/778d48ae40aa02947626f53f45773346.mp4?t=1702182550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras/b6725831aa9097a0ba0f6c422729982e.poster.avif?t=1702182550\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras/b6725831aa9097a0ba0f6c422729982e.webm?t=1702182550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras/b6725831aa9097a0ba0f6c422729982e.mp4?t=1702182550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras/2bb9ec6967363e94da95aa79e756187d.webp?t=1702182550\" /></div><br><br>Fight your way across the continent to free the rooster people from the clutches of the Brutal Baron. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras/7fea530b8e3d6195e9c8b57ade81b7dc.poster.avif?t=1702182550\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras/7fea530b8e3d6195e9c8b57ade81b7dc.webm?t=1702182550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras/7fea530b8e3d6195e9c8b57ade81b7dc.mp4?t=1702182550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras/1aaae5242f114630b2f45534743b29ea.poster.avif?t=1702182550\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras/1aaae5242f114630b2f45534743b29ea.webm?t=1702182550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras/1aaae5242f114630b2f45534743b29ea.mp4?t=1702182550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Attack enemy settlements to gain control of their farms, smithys and mines as you build your resources to ultimately put an end to the Brutal Baron's reign!",
